--- ③ 跨模态注意力：模型在看哪个词 ---
  注意力张量形状 [N, heads, 49, L] = (1172, 4, 49, 64)

  样本 0（真实类别: Black footed Albatross）
    描述: "the bird has head and beak proportional to its body and the bird is brown in color."
    被关注最多的词: . (0.225), brown (0.207), color (0.086), the (0.063), head (0.060), has (0.057)

  样本 1（真实类别: Black footed Albatross）
    描述: "the bird has a long black bill that is somewhat curved."
    被关注最多的词: . (0.355), [SEP] (0.180), long (0.084), curved (0.082), black (0.053), bird (0.051)

  样本 2（真实类别: Black footed Albatross）
    描述: "the wings are brown, long and narrow, and have white markings on the secondaries, the bill is blunt tipped and black, the head is light brown with a white thin marking between the eye and the beak."
    被关注最多的词: [SEP] (0.126), eye (0.091), bill (0.083), long (0.071), . (0.058), white (0.052)

  样本 3（真实类别: Black footed Albatross）
    描述: "here we have a bird soaring above the water and it's color is dark brown, he seems to have a long dark colored bill with a white ring around it on the upper part near the bill."
    被关注最多的词: brown (0.240), . (0.155), [SEP] (0.116), color (0.049), water (0.042), we (0.033)

  样本 4（真实类别: Black footed Albatross）
    描述: "the bird is brown with a crooked black beak and a large wingspan."
    被关注最多的词: brown (0.147), [SEP] (0.129), . (0.096), the (0.087), crooked (0.079), bird (0.077)

  按词性分组的平均注意力（400 个样本统计）:
    颜色词   (  949 个): 0.1227
    身体部位词(  801 个): 0.0290
    其他词   ( 5892 个): 0.0314
  解读：颜色是 CUB 描述里最有区分度的属性之一，模型给的注意力权重
        是否真的偏向这些词，是「跨模态对齐是否学到东西」的直接证据。
